{"id":"personal","lemma":"personal","pos":"adj","rank":535,"glosses":["personal"],"ipa":"/peɾsoˈnal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"personales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-personal.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso es demasiado personal.","en":"That's too personal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449129"},{"text":"Los ordenadores personales son muy útiles.","en":"Personal computers are very useful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705003"},{"text":"No es nada personal.","en":"It's nothing personal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460136"},{"text":"No te metas en mis asuntos personales.","en":"Don't stick your nose into my personal affairs."},{"text":"Estaban escasos de personal.","en":"They were shorthanded.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/415789"}]}